<h2 class="g-h2" id="quote-checks">Quote checks</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The status line under the quote answers two questions the build checks (<code>model_output.py</code>): is the quote in the text, and does it name this case. Keep every state: a missing passage must never look verified.</p></div>
{% set ex = "evidence-states" %}{% set exTitle = "Every quote status" %}{% set exStage = "g-example__stage--tint" %}{% include "guide/example.njk" %}
{{ table(["Field", "Value", "Line"], [
  ["<code>quote_status</code>", "<code>found</code>", "✓ In the opinion"],
  ["", "<code>stitched</code>", "✓ In the opinion, separate passages"],
  ["", "<code>partial</code>", "⚠ Only partly in the opinion"],
  ["", "<code>missing</code>", "✗ Not found in the opinion; no link to the passage"],
  ["", "anything else", "– Too short to check"],
  ["<code>quote_names</code>", "<code>cite</code> / <code>name</code>", "✓ Cites / Names this case"],
  ["", "anything else", "⚠ Does not name this case"]
]) }}

<h2 class="g-h2" id="parameters">Parameters</h2>
{{ params([
  ["card", "object", "", "<code>label</code>, <code>severity</code>, <code>rationale</code>, <code>quote</code>, <code>quote_html</code> (the quote escaped, the case in bold), <code>quote_status</code>, <code>quote_names</code>, optionally <code>other_label</code>. Rows carry them as <code>evidence_cards</code>."],
  ["defs", "object", "", "<code>treatment_definitions</code>."],
  ["where", "string", "\"the opinion\"", "Names the text the quote comes from in the status line."],
  ["href", "string", "\"\"", "A link to the passage on another page. Without it, the card renders a <em>Read in the opinion</em> button for the current page."],
  ["href_label", "string", "\"\"", "The link's text."],
  ["linkable", "boolean", "true", "<code>false</code> renders no way to the passage."]
]) }}

<h2 class="g-h2" id="behaviour">Behaviour</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The <em>Read in the opinion</em> button calls <code>readQuote</code> on the opinion page's <code>opinionTabs</code> component: it switches to the Opinion tab, finds the passage (the whole quote first, then its opening words), wraps it and flashes it. Outside the opinion page, pass <code>href</code>. In this guide the button explains where it works.</p></div>

<h2 class="g-h2" id="accessibility">Accessibility</h2>
<div class="g-prose"><p>The quote is a <code>&lt;blockquote&gt;</code>; the status marks are text, not colour alone. The passage link names where it goes.</p></div>

